# 🌳 Tree-Based Machine Learning & Ensemble Learning

A structured, hands-on learning journey covering **Decision Trees, Random Forest, XGBoost, and TensorFlow Decision Forests**.

This course is designed to build a strong practical understanding of tree-based machine-learning algorithms through **step-by-step concepts, Python implementation, line-by-line code explanations, model evaluation, visualization, hyperparameter tuning, and practical projects**.

---

## 🎯 Course Objective

The goal of this course is to understand how modern tree-based machine-learning algorithms work and how to apply them to real-world **classification and regression problems**.

By completing this course, I will learn how to:

* Build Decision Tree models
* Understand tree splitting and decision rules
* Perform classification using Decision Trees
* Perform regression using Decision Trees
* Understand Gini impurity and Entropy
* Understand information gain
* Control tree depth and overfitting
* Visualize Decision Trees
* Build Random Forest classifiers
* Build Random Forest regressors
* Understand ensemble learning
* Understand bagging and feature randomness
* Perform feature importance analysis
* Build XGBoost models
* Understand boosting
* Understand gradient boosting
* Train XGBoost classification and regression models
* Tune tree-based models
* Compare different ensemble algorithms
* Work with TensorFlow Decision Forests
* Build end-to-end tree-based ML solutions

